api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120003","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120003#pullrequestreview-4426968931"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120003"}},"submitted_at":"2026-06-04T10:22:12Z","commit_id":"ac63f596ee35bfe8d05ca154ad9326b75bcb84e0"},{"id":4426983148,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABB95m7A","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120003#pullrequestreview-4426983148","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120003","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120003#pullrequestreview-4426983148"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120003"}},"submitted_at":"2026-06-04T10:24:23Z","commit_id":"ac63f596ee35bfe8d05ca154ad9326b75bcb84e0"},{"id":4453862648,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCXiM-A","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\n\nCompared to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/64913, this implementation is much simpler, but it's also more involved to use on the script side (as you need to parse the CLI argument yourself).\n\nExample code:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar args := OS.get_cmdline_args()\n\tvar session_number := args.find(\"--session-number\")\n\tif session_number >= -1:\n\t\tvar session_number_value := int(args[session_number + 1])\n\t\tprint(\"Session number: %d\" % session_number_value)\n\n\tvar session_count := args.find(\"--session-count\")\n\tif session_count >= -1:\n\t\tvar session_count_value := int(args[session_count + 1])\n\t\tprint(\"Session count: %d\" % session_count_value)\n```\n\nResults in the following with 3 instances:\n\n```\nSession number: 1\nSession count: 3\nSession number: 2\nSession count: 3\nSession number: 3\nSession count: 3\n```\n\nNote that even with a single instance, `--session-number 1` and `--session-count 1` are still passed. These won't be passed if you run the project from the command line without specifying them explicitly though, so you should not assume the arguments to be present.\n\nOverall, this needs better documentation. I see two ways to improve this:\n\n- Document the `--session-number` and `--session-count` arguments in `main.cpp`'s command line help. It is possible to specify these arguments manually after all, even if you don't run the project through the editor.\n- Add a Label that describes multi-instance arguments to the Customize Run Instances dialog. Something like this:\n\n<img width=\"872\" height=\"636\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a69b695-c79c-4438-a187-fc2b84f321c7\" />","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120003#pullrequestreview-4453862648","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120003","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120003#pullrequestreview-4453862648"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120003"}},"submitted_at":"2026-06-08T22:30:11Z","commit_id":"e83d92d38ea801d455aa848a33de11403346c723"}]